From: BedrockOnLinux contributors
Subject: [PATCH] combase: implement cross-apartment context callbacks

Backport Wine's IContextCallback implementation and its required COM
interfaces from upstream commits 4caf188c, fc6ecfff, ad19f069, a3b1793d,
c77dc7cc, d2c35cca and 87555ec5.  This lets C++/WinRT resume an asynchronous
file-picker operation on its captured apartment instead of failing with
E_NOTIMPL.  RoFailFastWithErrorContext remains untouched.

